<title>UK: EIB sets 500 million mark fungible bond due 2003.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 500 million mark fungible bond due 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT  **500 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    22.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.14    PAY DATE    23.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    103.14    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**FUNGIBLE WITH 750 MLN MARK ISSUE LAUNCHED ON</p>
<p>		15.MAY.96, FROM PAYMENT DATE (PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST)</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
</text>
